'''Growths''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Plains]], specifically in [[Tar Pit|Tar pits]]. They, like [[Blob|Blobs]] and [[Oozer]]s, are large, gelatinous piles of sentient tar that emit poisonous black gasses.

