== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Growth|Aggressive creature strategies#Growth}}

=== Attack ===
Launches six orbs of tar at the enemy, applying the [[Tarred]] and [[Poison]] statuses (45 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]] and 50 [[Damage types#Poison|Poison]] damage). Each orb travels at 12 meters per second for up to 4 seconds before despawning and has a spread of 5–20 degrees. This ability can be used when a player is within 15 meters, and it has a cooldown of 8 seconds.

