== Notes ==
* Growths in the tar can be difficult to discern from a distance. Three or more growths may loosely surround the player, dealing high damage.
* They are hostile to other Plains creatures, which makes luring them into [[Deathsquito|Deathsquitos]], [[Fuling|Fulings]] or [[Lox]] a viable strategy to killing or distracting them. Lox will usually make quick work of them with their powerful AOE attacks.
* Killing them inside the tar pit may result in their loot being stuck

